  "lastName": "Del Bene",
  "overview": "I am a clinical neuropsychologist interested in aging, stroke/vascular cognitive impairment, Alzheimer's disease, and Parkinson's disease. Specifically, I am interested in vascular and medical contributions to neurodegenerative illness, and how these medical factors are influenced by social determinants of health. Additionally, I am interested in identifying and improving post-neurosurgical cognitive outcomes for deep brain stimulation in people with Parkinson's disease, and in the neuropsychological assessment of impaired physicians.",
